  <section><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/c2341a199132c97f4e9fa2b46af32f93effa291b"/></media></figure><para class="os-raise-text-center">
  <figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b98c2ee691d1230e7411c276dee1ad1666791c21"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/5360a02f827ff1737b2cce0b886cbec80afc7878"/></media></figure></para>








<figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/c2341a199132c97f4e9fa2b46af32f93effa291b"/></media></figure><para>Rice University 
6100 Main Street 
Houston, TX 77005 
